SUMMARY:Dave Pietro Quintet
LOCATION:Birdland Jazz Club\, Hell's Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Saxophonist Dave Pietro has been on the New York music scene si
 
nce 1987. A gifted saxophonist\, composer\, and educator\, he has performed
 
 at jazz clubs\, jazz festivals\, schools and concert halls around the worl
 
d. Dave is currently a member of the Maria Schneider Orchestra\, Darcy Jame
 
s Argues Secret Society\, and the Gil Evans Project as well as the jazz orc
 
hestras of Pete McGuinness\, Jihye Lee\, Tracy Yang\, and Chris Zuar. He wa
 
s also the lead alto saxophonist with the Toshiko Akiyoshi Jazz Orchestra f
 
rom 1994-2016. Dave has released eleven albums as a leader accompanied by m
 
usicians such as Brian Blade\, Scott Colley\, Dave Holland\, Kenny Werner\,
 
 Jay Anderson\, Johnathan Blake\, Michael Rodriguez\, and Billy Drummond. H
 
e is a passionate music educator and currently holds the position of Direct
 
or of Jazz Studies at New York University. This appearance at Birdland cele
 
brates the release of his most recent album Satori. Tickets & info: https:/
 
/www.ticketweb.com/event/dave-pietro-quintet-birdland-jazz-club-tickets/142
 
80794
